      <div style="margin-top:3.5rem;padding-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(44,57,48,0.1);">
        <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--tw-text-muted);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">References and Further Reading</p>
